Import the newer GitHub driver v5.2.2.4 which uses CFG80211 and is based
on newer Realtek sources, with modifications from Larry Finger. This
driver needs a considerable amount of work, particularly to the local
CONFIG directives in the Makefile. As it is based on newer/better
sources, this driver is the one to be working from going forwards. The
Makefile has been modified to build the module with the same .ko name as
the original sources in staging.

Suggested-by: Larry Finger <Larry.Finger@lwfinger.net>
Signed-off-by: Phillip Potter <phil@philpotter.co.uk>
