_smooth=3D%d, score=3D%d, score_smooth=3D%d, p_dm_odm->noisy_decision=3D%d\=
n",
+		total_cca_cnt, total_fa_cnt, p_dm_odm->noisy_decision_smooth, score, sco=
re_smooth, p_dm_odm->noisy_decision));
