+	* added experimental support for EAP-PSK
+	* added support for WE-19 (hostap, madwifi)
+
+2005-08-21 - v0.4.4
+	* fixed build without CONFIG_RSN_PREAUTH
+	* fixed FreeBSD build
+
+2005-06-26 - v0.4.3
+	* fixed PMKSA caching to copy User-Name and Class attributes so that
