+
+2005-06-12 - v0.4.2
+	* EAP-PAX is now registered as EAP type 46
+	* fixed EAP-PAX MAC calculation
+	* fixed EAP-PAX CK and ICK key derivation
+	* renamed eap_authenticator configuration variable to eap_server to
