+/*
+ * WPA Supplicant / shared MSCHAPV2 helper functions / RFC 2433 / RFC 2759
+ * Copyright (c) 2004-2009, Jouni Malinen <j@w1.fi>
+ *
+ * This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify
