+
+/**
+ * get_asymetric_start_key - GetAsymetricStartKey() - RFC 3079, Sect. 3.4
+ * @master_key: 16-octet MasterKey (IN)
+ * @session_key: 8-to-16 octet SessionKey (OUT)
