- RFC 2759, Sect. 8.10
+ * @password: 0-to-256-unicode-char Password (IN; ASCII)
+ * @password_len: Length of password
+ * @password_hash: 16-octet PasswordHash (IN)
+ * @pw_block: 516-byte PwBlock (OUT)
+ * Returns: 0 on success, -1 on failure
