@@ -0,0 +1,808 @@
+/*
+ * ndis_events - Receive NdisMIndicateStatus() events using WMI
+ * Copyright (c) 2004-2006, Jouni Malinen <j@w1.fi>
+ *
+ * This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify
