+	/*	Comment by Albert 2010/10/13 */
+	/*	Input data format: */
+	/*	Ex:  0 */
+	/*	Ex:  1XX:XX:XX:XX:XX:XXYYSSID */
+	/*	0 =3D> Reflush the profile record list. */
+	/*	1 =3D> Add the profile list */
+	/*	XX:XX:XX:XX:XX:XX =3D> peer's MAC Address ( ex: 00:E0:4C:00:00:01 ) */
+	/*	YY =3D> SSID Length */
