+		/* We have to backup the PMK information for WiFi PMK Caching test item.=
 */
+		/*  */
+		/* Backup the btkip_countermeasure information. */
+		/* When the countermeasure is trigger, the driver have to disconnect wit=
h AP for 60 seconds. */
